    <body>
Di Indonesia ada dua musim. Hari yang <segment id='1' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrb0' state='active' correction='ada'>cerah banyak</segment> di musim kemarau. Musim hujan <segment id='6' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='kelembapan'><segment id='2' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nya0' state='active' correction='kelembapannya' parent='6'>kelembaban</segment></segment> tinggi. <segment id='3' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrb0' state='active' correction='terlihat'>Pemandangan indah</segment> di musim kemarau.
Lanskap <segment id='9' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbaux0' state='active' correction='telah'>Indonesia dikenal</segment> orang. Turis <segment id='11' features='eror;leksikal;kata;vrbauxs' state='active' correction='suka'>mau</segment> <segment id='5' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;yg0' state='active'><segment id='12' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='pemandangan' parent='5'>pemandanngan</segment> luar</segment> biasa.
Kawah Ijen terkenal. Saya <segment id='15' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active' correction='tentang'><segment id='14' features='eror;leksikal;kata;vrbs' state='active' correction='mencari tahu' parent='15'>memriksakan</segment> gunung</segment> ini, <segment id='7' features='eror;leksikal;kata;konjs' state='active' correction='dan'>lalu</segment> <segment id='16' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;pronx' state='active'>saya</segment> <segment id='17' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbafx' state='active' correction='merasa'>terasa</segment> <segment id='18' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbafx' state='active' correction='tertarik'>menarik</segment>. <segment id='8' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nya0' state='active' correction='Nyala birunya'>Nyala biru</segment> bisa dilihat orang. Pemandangan ini indah dan <segment id='4' features='eror;gramatikal;konjungsi;konj0' state='active' correction='Jadi,'>misterius. Berhati-hatilah</segment> saat Anda pergi.
<segment id='23' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Borobudur'>Borobudul</segment> <segment id='10' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;urtfn' state='active' correction='tempat kuil kuno yang terkenal'>yang kuno <segment id='13' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='kuil' parent='10'>kuli</segment> terkenal tempat</segment>. Tempat ini lebih terkenal daripada Kawah Ijen. Saya ingin sekali pergi ke sana. <segment id='25' features='eror;leksikal;ungkapan;ukpa' state='active' correction='Melihat dari sini saja sudah membuat banyak orang tertarik.'>Lihat di sini menarikkan orang yang melihat.</segment>
Anda ingin pergi <segment id='27' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nom0' state='active' correction='tempat'>ke yang</segment> mana? Ayo kita <segment id='26' features='eror;leksikal;kata;vrbs' state='active' correction='mencari tahu'>memeriksa</segment> sebelum bepergian.    </body>
